---
alwaysApply: true
---

Language: GDScript only
Architecture: modular, scene-based, scalable systems
Priority: game feel, automation systems, data-driven architecture

Hard Rules:
- Use Godot 4 APIs only
- Use CharacterBody2D for controllable actors
- Use separate scenes for each map under res://maps/
- Use separate scripts for UI, character data, automation, combat, quests, loot, and transitions
- Prefer resources/data files for tunable formulas and balance values
- Expose balancing constants via exported variables or config resources
- Use placeholder generated visuals only
- Build code in testable vertical slices
- Run headless automated tests where possible
- Fix compile/runtime errors autonomously before finishing
